<title>POLAND: COMPUTERLAND WINS PLN 3.5 MLN CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>COMPUTERLAND WINS PLN 3.5 MLN CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish software firm ComputerLand Poland SA signed a 3.5-million-zloty contract for the computerisation of Poland's welfare system, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>ComputerLand will provide or upgrade programming services at 900 municipal and provincial welfare offices, serving about 800,000 people, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
